@startuml InterService_Communication
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Figure 4.4 — Inter-Service Communication Map

note as N1
  All calls are synchronous REST
  (Spring RestTemplate / RestClient).
  Two auth patterns:
  1. JWT forwarding (user-initiated)
  2. X-Internal-Api-Secret (service-initiated)
end note

package "Core Services" {
  rectangle "Transaction\nService\n:8084" as TX #6DB33F
  rectangle "Fraud\nService\n:8086" as FRAUD #6DB33F
  rectangle "Account\nService\n:8083" as ACCOUNT #6DB33F
  rectangle "Payment\nService\n:8085" as PAY #6DB33F
  rectangle "Client\nService\n:8082" as CLIENT #6DB33F
  rectangle "Auth\nService\n:8081" as AUTH #6DB33F
}

' === Grid layout (3 rows x 2 cols) ===
TX -[hidden]right-> FRAUD
ACCOUNT -[hidden]right-> PAY
CLIENT -[hidden]right-> AUTH

TX -[hidden]down-> ACCOUNT
ACCOUNT -[hidden]down-> CLIENT
FRAUD -[hidden]down-> PAY
PAY -[hidden]down-> AUTH

' === Core banking flows ===
ACCOUNT -up-> TX : Create debit/credit tx records\n[JWT forwarded]
ACCOUNT -up-> FRAUD : Fraud evaluation (sync, Tier 1 + Tier 2)\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]

' === Fraud pipeline: Tier 2 sync context fetch ===
FRAUD -left-> TX : Fetch tx history (sync, Tier 2)\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]

' === Fraud alert resolution: freeze/unfreeze accounts ===
FRAUD -down-> ACCOUNT : Freeze / unfreeze account\n(on fraud alert resolution)\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]

' === Payment settlement ===
PAY -left-> ACCOUNT : Apply Stripe top-up credit\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]

' === Encryption lifecycle & step-up MFA ===
AUTH -left-> CLIENT : Re-encrypt PII on password change\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]
ACCOUNT -down-> AUTH : Verify step-up TOTP code\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]
CLIENT -right-> AUTH : Verify step-up TOTP code\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]

' === GDPR erasure cascade (all from client-service) ===
CLIENT -right-> AUTH : Deactivate user (GDPR)\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]
CLIENT -up-> ACCOUNT : Fetch account IDs + close all accounts (GDPR)\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]
CLIENT -up-> TX : Anonymize transaction details (GDPR)\n[X-Internal-Api-Secret]

@enduml
